{"text": "The cause of all this noise was a white borzoi puppy with a sharp nose and a yellow spot on its back. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It sat in the middle of the crowd with its front legs spread, shaking from head to tail. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In its watery eyes there was a look of misery and terror. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I was walking along quietly, sir, not bothering anyone, began Khryukin the goldsmith, coughing into his fist. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I was talking about some firewood with Mitry Mitrich when this nasty dog suddenly bit my finger for no reason. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am a working man, and my work is delicate, so I may not be able to use this finger for a week. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You must make the owner pay me, sir, for there is no law that says we must suffer from beasts. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If every dog were allowed to bite people, life would not be worth living in this world. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ochumelov frowned and said sternly, Whose dog is this, I will not let this pass, and its owner will pay a heavy fine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yeldyrin, find out whose dog it is and write a report, since it may be mad and must be destroyed at once.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "c", "a", "u", "s", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "i", "s", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "w", "h", "i", "t", "e", " ", "b", "o", "r", "z", "o", "i", " ", "p", "u", "p", "p", "y", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "s", "h", "a", "r", "p", " ", "n", "o", "s", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "y", "e", "l", "l", "o", "w", " ", "s", "p", "o", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "i", "t", "s", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "i", "d", "d", "l", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "r